<title>UK: Calor H1 pretax profit cools.</title>
<headline>Calor H1 pretax profit cools.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		11.6		   vs 10.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.0		    vs 6.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     25.0		   vs 26.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   162.8		  vs 147.8</p>
<p>Note - Calor Group Plc, a distributor of bottled gas, said on Monday that a 14.0 million stg restructuing charge, announced in March, was offset by a 13.2 million stg profit on the sale of its interest in Pam Gas.</p>
</text>
